ial recognition feature, HoloMon also recognizes the real world.\nIf you nod or make a hand sign, HoloMon will respond to you.\nEnjoy your life with HoloMon.", "short_description": "This is an application to make friends with the mixed reality pet \"HolographicMonster(HoloMon)\".\nThe goal is to live with HoloMon in the real world and raise him to be a big monster.\nYou can give HoloMon food, play with a ball, and so on."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverSquare_1440x1440_1-1.png", "id": "9172328979490389", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57570293_9172328986157055_8670910801304381989_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c7qzJJ3gaAQQ7kNvwErIAFj&_nc_oc=AdqaUEe3lpxM2Vst7POuJj7MY6nRbLvPPSpRy0nrUnbk5TN4JuybMO8E4xKXY0pmRg4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSKDHQODh4Cw6g8LroxoVxlvg1ekb9kv3SKLCUWXkPpgA&oe=6B099E46"}, {"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900_10-3.png", "id": "2288044464904587", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982472_2288044468237920_89714264810729936_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B8BTtvelFyEQ7kNvwGImzXj&_nc_oc=Ado1_j5jv0YdmPoiZg1_RU9wVrjWwTACxypMo94-I2kzQiV7y-pdSpuy29La6ZBW4eI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ56iW1V5dvN17DGSi-JA3DIbUB_-PriEb2wJwFJ0y-hQ&oe=6B09BEE0"}, {"file_name": "CoverLandscape_2560x1440_16-9.png", "id": "1819020505602835", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982637_1819020508936168_3095875184930134309_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j6FUPJ5-YVgQ7kNvwEXAoAV&_nc_oc=Ado8oujDHCuSXLJSOpwwnibpkM3VTqnXwbnDJWZmsdObqVBSSIzAkk3vf7xrzX2spa8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSXyBt3NAAaCY7mEfyJA8DNBmGvnPrBd8J4j57jAHYYEg&oe=6B09A551"}, {